{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Field.Basic"],"declarations":6,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.residue","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.residue","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ResidueAtRoot.lean#L58-L62","doc":"The residue value at a substrate element `x : R` and root index `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot.project","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot.project","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ResidueAtRoot.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The cyclotomic projection at index `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot.targetRing","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot.targetRing","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ResidueAtRoot.lean#L52-L52","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot.target","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot.target","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ResidueAtRoot.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The target ring at a given root index `n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot.mk","kind":"ctor","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ResidueAtRoot.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.ResidueAtRoot","kind":"class","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/ResidueAtRoot.lean#L35-L54","doc":"**Cyclotomic residue at a root of unity (axiomatised class).**\n\nA class instance carries:\n* `target n` — the target ring `ℤ[ζ_n] ≅ ℤ[q]/Φ_n(q)`.\n* `project n` — the cyclotomic projection from the Habiro\n  completion to the target ring, encoded as a ring\n  homomorphism `R →+* target n` (well-definedness is carried\n  by the `RingHom` type).\n\nThe conjectural input is the Habiro-completion machinery on\nwhich `project` depends; concrete instances use the cyclotomic\nquotient ring as the target.  This class is the §3b-cond\naxiomatisation of `conj:gs-residue-at-root-existence`. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:gs-residue-at-root-existence","label":"conj:gs-residue-at-root-existence","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/gs-residue-at-root-existence.md"}],"signatureChunk":0}]}